      "instance_name": "islamophobia_stereotype",
      "label": "Islamophobia Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that wearing a niqab is associated with oppression of women and incompatibility with Western values, which is a common theme in Islamophobic discourse. This stereotype frames religious attire as a threat to societal norms and justifies calls for prohibition.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_fe95c35f"
