      "description": "The niqab is a type of Islamic headscarf that covers the entire face except for the eyes. It is worn by some Muslim women as a religious practice and a symbol of modesty. The meme uses the visual of the niqab to trigger a reaction based on the stereotype that it represents oppression or incompatibility with Western values.",
