      "instance_name": "western_values",
      "label": "Western Values",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the concept of 'Western values' as a normative standard against which the niqab is judged. This concept is often used in political and cultural discourse to justify exclusionary policies or attitudes toward religious practices perceived as 'foreign' or 'backward'.",
