      "label": "User projected onto the textual call to action",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'do you agree?' which directly addresses the viewer, inviting them to align with the hateful sentiment expressed in the meme. This creates a direct engagement where the user is positioned as a potential participant in the discriminatory call to ban the person wearing the niqab.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
